  "historyNote": "#9986, eff 9-1-11, EXPIRED: 9-1-19 (from He-P 1605.07) New. #13052, eff 6-11-20; ss by #14230, eff 4-2-25; ss by #14680, eff 8-26-26, EXPIRES: 8-26-36",
